Routal runs on Talos Linux (https://github.com/siderolabs/talos, Copyright (c)
Sidero Labs, Inc., MPL-2.0). It does not include Talos source code.

The extension image bundles unmodified Alpine Linux packages, notably nftables
(GPL-2.0) and its libraries, run as separate programs. Their sources are
available from https://pkgs.alpinelinux.org and https://netfilter.org.
